  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* feat(licenses): custom license definitions and unlicensed vendored code by @anistark in https://github.com/anistark/feluda/pull/244\r\n* build(deps): bump the cargo group across 2 directories with 1 update by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/anistark/feluda/pull/245\r\n* build(deps): update all outdated dependencies and raise MSRV to 1.88 by @anistark in https://github.com/anistark/feluda/pull/246\r\n* feat(sbom): identify packages by ecosystem and PURL by @anistark in https://github.com/anistark/feluda/pull/250\r\n* feat(sbom): read an existing SBOM as a scan source by @anistark in https://github.com/anistark/feluda/pull/251\r\n* feat(filesystem): catalog installed apk and dpkg packages by @anistark in https://github.com/anistark/feluda/pull/255\r\n* docs: rework the features page and surface the version in the UI by @anistark in https://github.com/anistark/feluda/pull/256\r\n* feat(filesystem): catalog installed rpm packages by @anistark in https://github.com/anistark/feluda/pull/259\r\n* feat(licenses): resolve unknown licenses from ClearlyDefined by @anistark in https://github.com/anistark/feluda/pull/260\r\n* chore: adds new release by @farhaanbukhsh in https://github.com/anistark/feluda/pull/261\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/anistark/feluda/compare/v1.15.0...v1.16.0",
